{"candidateAnswer":"A piece of jewelry","evidence":"[D4:3 | 10:37 am on 27 June, 2023] Caroline: Thanks, Melanie! This necklace is super special to me - a gift from my grandma in my home country, Sweden. She gave it to me when I was young, and it stands for love, faith and strength. It's like a reminder of my roots and all the love and support I get from my family.","itemId":"urn:uuid:124f97fa-2e15-584d-ab0a-1a30f543bee8","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:2abc25720a02176a6848ee273607c7f300cdd58774ddeae30d15abc54dfceaef","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What was grandma's gift to Caroline?","referenceAnswer":"necklace","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"2abc25720a02176a6848ee273607c7f300cdd58774ddeae30d15abc54dfceaef"}}]}